The Problem: "The Empty Spaces" (Missing Data)
The Problem: "The Clones" (Duplicate Data)
The Problem: "The Typos & Messy Typing" (Text Formatting)
The Problem: "The Imposters" (Wrong Data Types)
final secret skill: Knowing how to combine them
Text ➡️
SELECT CAST(quantity_text AS INT) AS clean_quantity FROM Sales;
Number ➡️ Decimal
SELECT CAST(whole_price AS DECIMAL(10,2)) AS price_with_cents FROM Sales;
 Number/Date ➡️ Text
SELECT 'Order number: ' || CAST(order_id AS VARCHAR) AS order_label FROM Sales;
Text ➡️ Date
SELECT CAST(date_text AS DATE) AS clean_date FROM Sales;
Professional Data Cleaning step by step:
DUPLICATE > Typos & Text formatting > Empty Spaces > REPLACE > Data Type
DISTINCT > TRIM > COALESCE > REPLACE > CAST




-- 1. "THE TYPOS & MESSY TYPING" (Text Formatting)
-- Weapon: TRIM()
SELECT
    TRIM(LOWER(email_address)) AS clean_email,
    TRIM(UPPER(country_code))  AS clean_country
FROM sales;

 
-- 2. "THE EMPTY SPACES" (Missing Data)
-- Weapon: COALESCE()
 
SELECT
    COALESCE(discount_amount, 0.00) AS clean_discount,
    COALESCE(customer_name, 'Unknown') AS clean_name
FROM sales;

-- 3. "THE IMPOSTERS" (Wrong Data Types)
-- Weapon: CAST()

SELECT
    CAST(revenue_text AS NUMERIC) AS mathematical_revenue,
    CAST(signup_string AS DATE) AS actual_signup_date
FROM sales;

-- 4. "THE CLONES" (Duplicate Data)
-- Weapon: DISTINCT

SELECT
    DISTINCT Order_id
FROM sales;



SELECT
            DISTINCT Order_id,
            TRIM(LOWER(Product_name)) AS New_product_name,
            TRIM(UPPER(Frist_name)) AS New_First_name,
            REPLACE(Phone_number, '_', ' ') AS New_number,
            COALESCE(Product_price, 0.00) AS New_price,
            COALESCE(Customer_Name, 'Unknown_name') AS New_name,
            CAST(Tracking_id AS INT) AS New_tracking,
            CAST(Address AS VARCHAR) AS New_address,
            CAST(Print_date AS DATE) AS New_date,
FROM sales;

